            "textId": "done-block:paper-mock-nb-2026-m2:grammar-fill:1",
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-mock-nb-2026-m2:grammar-fill:1",
            "text": "After graduating from college, Jing Ran, a young entrepreneur, was determined to devote his life to solving a pressing social challenge rather than pursue a conventional career."
          },
          {
            "textId": "done-block:paper-mock-nb-2026-m2:grammar-fill:2",
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-mock-nb-2026-m2:grammar-fill:2",
            "text": "He spent months traveling across the country, observing life in cities, towns and rural communities. What struck him was how much aging had become a part of Chinese society. “The streets were filled with elderly residents actively involved in leisure activities,” Jing recalled. The journey eventually led him to a clear goal: transforming aging from a period of limitation into one of dignity and joy."
          },
          {
            "textId": "done-block:paper-mock-nb-2026-m2:grammar-fill:3",
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-mock-nb-2026-m2:grammar-fill:3",
            "text": "Today, Jing is the founder of Time Light Care Group, a company focusing on innovative solutions to improve elderly care. Among its innovations is a hospital shuttle(接驳车) equipped with a smart seat. With the press of a button, the seat slides out of the vehicle and turns into an electric wheelchair, allowing the elderly to enter the hospital independently without the unpleasant experience of being lifted from one vehicle to another."
          },
          {
            "textId": "done-block:paper-mock-nb-2026-m2:grammar-fill:4",
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-mock-nb-2026-m2:grammar-fill:4",
            "text": "Besides, most facilities are located within urban neighborhoods rather than in remote areas, making it easier for families to visit regularly and for everyday social ties to endure. Keeping seniors close to their original communities helps preserve their routines and interests that/which once brought them joy and well-being at home."
          }
        ],
